 .SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
 .TP
 .B Ctrl+Shift+F1-F12
@@ -178,6 +183,10 @@ The kmscon project was created by David Herrmann.
 This version is maintained by the AURORA NAS Project with additional
 patches for Debian 13 Trixie compatibility.
 
+.SH BOOT INTEGRATION
+When systemd is used with Plymouth, kmscon automatically coordinates DRM
